@startuml
title EventFlow — UML State Machine: Booking Lifecycle
[*] --> Draft

Draft --> Held : seats selected / availability confirmed
Draft --> Cancelled : customer cancels

Held --> PaymentPending : checkout initiated
Held --> Expired : reservation timeout
Held --> Cancelled : customer cancels

PaymentPending --> Confirmed : payment authorized and verified
PaymentPending --> PaymentFailed : payment declined
PaymentPending --> Expired : payment timeout / hold expires
PaymentPending --> Cancelled : cancellation permitted

PaymentFailed --> PaymentPending : retry payment
PaymentFailed --> Cancelled : customer abandons

Confirmed --> Cancelled : cancellation policy permits
Confirmed --> [*] : event completed

Expired --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

state Confirmed {
  [*] --> TicketPending
  TicketPending --> TicketIssued : ticket generation succeeds
  TicketPending --> TicketError : generation fails
  TicketError --> TicketPending : retry issuance
  TicketIssued --> [*]
}

note right of Held
  Seat hold is temporary.
  Expiration must release
  inventory atomically.
end note

note right of Confirmed
  Confirmation requires
  verified payment status.
  Ticket issuance is idempotent.
end note
@enduml
